#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"This release is an emergency release to fix security vulnerabilities in the "
"Linux kernel and the implementation of the Perl programming language."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<h1 id=\"changes\">Changes and updates</h1>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Update *Linux* to 6.1.133, which fixes [multiple security "
"vulnerabilities](https://www.debian.org/security/2025/dsa-5900-1)  that may "
"lead to a privilege escalation or information leaks."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Update *perl* to 5.36.0-7+deb12u2, which fixes a [heap-based buffer overflow "
"vulnerability](https://www.debian.org/security/2025/dsa-5902-1), which may "
"result in denial of service, or potentially the execution of arbitrary code."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"For more details, read our [[!tails_gitweb debian/changelog "
"desc=\"changelog\"]]."
msgstr ""
"Pour plus de détails, lisez notre [[!tails_gitweb debian/changelog desc="
"\"liste des changements\"]]."

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<h1 id=\"get\">Get Tails 6.14.2</h1>\n"
msgstr "<h1 id=\"get\">Obtenir Tails 6.14.2</h1>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To upgrade your Tails USB stick and keep your Persistent Storage"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid "- Automatic upgrades are available from Tails 6.0 or later to 6.14.2."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"If you cannot do an automatic upgrade or if Tails fails to start after an "
"automatic upgrade, please try to do a [[manual "
"upgrade|doc/upgrade/#manual]]."
